%% High-level architecture diagram for Learn English
```mermaid
graph TD
    User((User))
    subgraph Frontend [Frontend Client - React / Vite]
        UI[UI Components: Radix & Tailwind]
        WebRTC[Mediasoup Client (WebRTC)]
        SocketClient[Socket.io Client]
        HTTPClient[Axios REST Client]
    end

    subgraph External_Services [External Services]
        S3[(AWS S3)]
        GoogleAuth[Google OAuth]
        Razorpay[Razorpay]
    end

    subgraph Backend [Node.js + Express API]
        Router[API Router & Controllers]
        Auth[Auth: JWT + Refresh Tokens]
        WSServer[Socket.io Server]
        SFU[Mediasoup SFU]
        UploadService[Upload Presign Service]
    end

    subgraph Data_Tier [Data & Cache]
        Mongo[(MongoDB)]
        Redis[(Redis: Cache & BullMQ backend)]
    end

    subgraph Worker_Tier [Workers]
        Queue[BullMQ / Job Queue]
        Worker[Background Worker Processes]
    end

    User --> Frontend
    UI --> HTTPClient
    UI --> WebRTC
    UI --> SocketClient

    HTTPClient -->|REST API| Router
    SocketClient -->|WS| WSServer
    WebRTC -->|Media| SFU

    Router --> Mongo
    Router --> Redis
    Router --> UploadService
    UploadService --> S3
    Router --> Razorpay
    Auth --> GoogleAuth

    Router --> Queue
    Queue --> Worker
    Worker --> Mongo
    Worker --> S3
    Worker -->|Inference| Worker

    WSServer --> Redis
    WSServer --> Router
```